@baseUrl = http://localhost:3003
@imageId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Upload an image (replace the file path with a local image)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/images/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=example

--example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerId"

property-123
--example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="ownerType"

HomeImages
--example
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./photo.jpg
--example--

### Query property images
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/images/query?filters=ownerId%3D%3Dproperty-123

### Get image and poll status until Ready or Failed
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/images/{{imageId}}

### Update display metadata
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/images/{{imageId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"altText":"Living room","order":0,"isCover":true}

### Delete image
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/images/{{imageId}}
